OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AIf hackers can take control of a
OL,4,Asupermarket freezer, how vulnerable is
OL,5,Aother tech?
OL,6,
OL,7,FSupermarkets across Europe have been
OL,8,Fhit by a suspected cyber-attack
OL,9,Faffecting their fridges and freezers,
OL,10,Fand raising concern about the
OL,11,Fvulnerabilities of internet-connected
OL,12,Fhardware from industrial machinery to
OL,13,Fhumble domestic appliances.
OL,15,FSmart devices which are connected to
OL,16,Fthe internet can include fridges,
OL,17,Fcentral heating, and even washing
OL,18,Fmachines.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
